{
  "id": 1669,
  "name": "tera-orb",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "event-items",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/20/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "結晶の力を　秘めている　オーブ。エネルギーが　チャージされているとポケモンを　テラスタル　させる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "결정의 힘을 간직하고 있는 오브. 에너지가 충전되면 포켓몬을 테라스탈시킬 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "秘藏著結晶之力的寶珠。在蓄足了能量的狀態下可使寶可夢太晶化。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un orbe qui renferme le pouvoir de la cristallisation. Quand il est chargé d’énergie, il permet à un Pokémon de se téracristalliser.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diesem Orb wohnt Kristallisierungskraft inne. Ist er vollständig aufgeladen, kann er Pokémon terakristallisieren.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una esfera que encierra en su interior el poder de la cristalización. Al cargarse de energía, permite a los Pokémon teracristalizarse.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una sfera che racchiude il potere della cristallizzazione. Se caricata di energia, permette di teracristallizzare i Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An orb that holds within it the power to crystallize. When it is charged with energy, it can be used to cause Pokémon to Terastallize.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "結晶の力を　秘めている　オーブ。エネルギーが　チャージされているとポケモンを　テラスタル　させる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "蕴藏着结晶之力的宝珠。经过蓄能之后，能够让宝可梦太晶化。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
